{
  "name": "AI Resume Screener and Scoring",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "screen-resume",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "name": "Webhook - Resume Input",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [250, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "chat",
        "operation": "message",
        "model": "gpt-4o",
        "messages": {
          "values": [
            {
              "content": "=You are an expert HR recruiter AI. Score the following resume against the job requirements.\n\nJob Requirements:\n{{ $json.body.job_requirements || 'General software engineering position' }}\n\nProvide scores from 0-100 for each category and an overall score.\nReturn ONLY valid JSON:\n{\n  \"candidate_name\": \"extracted name\",\n  \"overall_score\": 85,\n  \"skills_score\": 80,\n  \"experience_score\": 90,\n  \"education_score\": 85,\n  \"skills_match\": [\"matched skill 1\", \"matched skill 2\"],\n  \"skills_missing\": [\"missing skill 1\"],\n  \"years_experience\": 5,\n  \"strengths\": [\"strength 1\", \"strength 2\"],\n  \"concerns\": [\"concern 1\"],\n  \"recommendation\": \"Strongly Recommend / Recommend / Consider / Pass\"\n}\n\nResume:\n{{ $json.body.resume_text }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "temperature": 0.2,
          "maxTokens": 1500
        }
      },
      "name": "OpenAI - Score Resume",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.openAi",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [500, 300],
      "credentials": {
        "openAiApi": {
          "id": "",
          "name": ""
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const items = $input.all();\nconst aiResponse = items[0].json.message.content;\nlet parsed;\ntry {\n  parsed = JSON.parse(aiResponse);\n} catch(e) {\n  parsed = { candidate_name: 'Unknown', overall_score: 0, skills_score: 0, experience_score: 0, education_score: 0, recommendation: 'Error parsing' };\n}\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    candidateName: parsed.candidate_name || 'Unknown',\n    overallScore: parsed.overall_score || 0,\n    skillsScore: parsed.skills_score || 0,\n    experienceScore: parsed.experience_score || 0,\n    educationScore: parsed.education_score || 0,\n    skillsMatch: Array.isArray(parsed.skills_match) ? parsed.skills_match.join(', ') : '',\n    skillsMissing: Array.isArray(parsed.skills_missing) ? parsed.skills_missing.join(', ') : '',\n    yearsExperience: parsed.years_experience || 0,\n    strengths: Array.isArray(parsed.strengths) ? parsed.strengths.join(', ') : '',\n    concerns: Array.isArray(parsed.concerns) ? parsed.concerns.join(', ') : '',\n    recommendation: parsed.recommendation || 'N/A',\n    date: new Date().toISOString().split('T')[0]\n  }\n}];"
      },
      "name": "Code - Parse Scores",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [750, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "append",
        "documentId": { "__rl": true, "mode": "list", "value": "" },
        "sheetName": { "__rl": true, "mode": "list", "value": "gid=0" },
        "columns": {
          "value": {
            "Date": "={{ $json.date }}",
            "Candidate": "={{ $json.candidateName }}",
            "Overall Score": "={{ $json.overallScore }}",
            "Skills Score": "={{ $json.skillsScore }}",
            "Experience Score": "={{ $json.experienceScore }}",
            "Education Score": "={{ $json.educationScore }}",
            "Recommendation": "={{ $json.recommendation }}",
            "Strengths": "={{ $json.strengths }}",
            "Concerns": "={{ $json.concerns }}"
          },
          "schema": [
            { "id": "Date", "type": "string", "display": true },
            { "id": "Candidate", "type": "string", "display": true },
            { "id": "Overall Score", "type": "string", "display": true },
            { "id": "Skills Score", "type": "string", "display": true },
            { "id": "Experience Score", "type": "string", "display": true },
            { "id": "Education Score", "type": "string", "display": true },
            { "id": "Recommendation", "type": "string", "display": true },
            { "id": "Strengths", "type": "string", "display": true },
            { "id": "Concerns", "type": "string", "display": true }
          ],
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "name": "Google Sheets - Ranking",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.1,
      "position": [1000, 300],
      "credentials": {
        "googleSheetsOAuth2Api": {
          "id": "",
          "name": ""
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "number": [
            {
              "value1": "={{ $json.overallScore }}",
              "value2": 80,
              "operation": "largerEqual"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "name": "IF - Score Above 80",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [1250, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "sendTo": "hr@example.com",
        "subject": "=🌟 High-Score Candidate: {{ $json.candidateName }} (Score: {{ $json.overallScore }})",
        "message": "=<h2>High-Potential Candidate Alert</h2>\n<p><strong>Candidate:</strong> {{ $json.candidateName }}</p>\n<p><strong>Overall Score:</strong> {{ $json.overallScore }}/100</p>\n<p><strong>Skills:</strong> {{ $json.skillsScore }} | <strong>Experience:</strong> {{ $json.experienceScore }} | <strong>Education:</strong> {{ $json.educationScore }}</p>\n<p><strong>Recommendation:</strong> {{ $json.recommendation }}</p>\n<p><strong>Strengths:</strong> {{ $json.strengths }}</p>\n<p><strong>Concerns:</strong> {{ $json.concerns }}</p>\n<p><strong>Matched Skills:</strong> {{ $json.skillsMatch }}</p>\n<p><strong>Missing Skills:</strong> {{ $json.skillsMissing }}</p>",
        "options": {}
      },
      "name": "Gmail - Notify HR",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.gmail",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [1500, 200],
      "credentials": {
        "gmailOAuth2": {
          "id": "",
          "name": ""
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "width": 800,
        "height": 200,
        "content": "## AI Resume Screener & Scoring\n\n**Setup:**\n1. Connect OpenAI API, Gmail OAuth2, Google Sheets OAuth2\n2. Set spreadsheet ID in Google Sheets node\n3. POST to webhook: `{\"resume_text\": \"full resume text...\", \"job_requirements\": \"required skills and experience...\"}`\n\nScores resumes on skills/experience/education (0-100), logs to Sheets, and notifies HR if overall score ≥ 80."
      },
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [250, 500]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Webhook - Resume Input": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "OpenAI - Score Resume", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "OpenAI - Score Resume": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "Code - Parse Scores", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "Code - Parse Scores": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "Google Sheets - Ranking", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "Google Sheets - Ranking": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "IF - Score Above 80", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "IF - Score Above 80": {
      "main": [
        [{ "node": "Gmail - Notify HR", "type": "main", "index": 0 }],
        []
      ]
    }
  }
}